WEBVTT

1
00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:45.000
After describing the glory

2
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.458
of supreme knowledge,

3
00:00:46.458 --> 00:00:49.625
Lord Krishna now explains how jivatmas –

4
00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:51.208
though divine and eternal

5
00:00:51.208 --> 00:00:54.500
by nature – come into

6
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.875
contact with the material world.

7
00:00:57.875 --> 00:01:00.625
In verses 14.3

8
00:01:00.625 --> 00:01:01.500
and 14.4,

9
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.166
He describes the process of creation –

10
00:01:04.166 --> 00:01:07.625
in which He, as the supreme father,

11
00:01:07.625 --> 00:01:10.875
places the seed of life into the womb
of material nature,

12
00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:14.958
and from that all living beings arise.

13
00:01:14.958 --> 00:01:17.833
These verses make clear

14
00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:18.750
that Lord Krishna

15
00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:21.250
is the ultimate cause of all living beings

16
00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:22.916
coming into existence.

17
00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.625
Prakriti is the womb

18
00:01:24.625 --> 00:01:27.708
from which jivatmas take birth.

19
00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:29.000
Thus every living

20
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.875
being in creation is Lord Krishna’s own child.

21
00:01:37.583 --> 00:01:40.416
In verse 14.3,

22
00:01:40.416 --> 00:01:44.208
Lord Krishna mentions mahat-Brahman –

23
00:01:44.208 --> 00:01:47.916
the unmanifest material nature,

24
00:01:47.916 --> 00:01:50.583
from which creation begins.

25
00:01:50.583 --> 00:01:54.500
Lord Krishna calls this the yoni – the womb –

26
00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:56.750
meaning that material nature

27
00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:58.000
is the field

28
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.791
from which creation manifests.

29
00:02:00.791 --> 00:02:04.458
But this womb remains inactive

30
00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:06.583
until Lord Krishna, the Supreme,

31
00:02:06.583 --> 00:02:09.875
infuses it with life-force.

32
00:02:09.875 --> 00:02:11.958
This is not a physical action,

33
00:02:11.958 --> 00:02:13.666
but the process

34
00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:15.291
by which Lord Krishna

35
00:02:15.291 --> 00:02:17.333
activates prakriti.

36
00:02:17.333 --> 00:02:18.083
At that moment

37
00:02:18.083 --> 00:02:22.000
creation begins, and jivatmas

38
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.958
according to their past karma

39
00:02:23.958 --> 00:02:26.666
enter various bodies.

40
00:02:26.666 --> 00:02:27.458
Just as a father

41
00:02:27.458 --> 00:02:30.500
provides the seed for conception,

42
00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:31.750
Lord Krishna places

43
00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.708
the seed of the conscious jivatma

44
00:02:33.708 --> 00:02:35.875
into the womb of prakriti.

45
00:02:35.875 --> 00:02:37.291
From this, jivatmas

46
00:02:37.291 --> 00:02:40.000
receive their material bodies.

47
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:43.916
In verse 14.4, Lord Krishna

48
00:02:43.916 --> 00:02:45.875
becomes even clearer.

49
00:02:45.875 --> 00:02:48.708
He explains that prakriti is the mother

50
00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:50.625
who provides the body,

51
00:02:50.625 --> 00:02:53.875
and He is the seed-giving father who

52
00:02:53.875 --> 00:02:56.875
infuses the conscious soul.

53
00:02:56.875 --> 00:02:58.000
Whether devas,

54
00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:01.583
humans, animals, birds, or plants –

55
00:03:01.583 --> 00:03:06.041
all forms become possible through
this divine combination.

56
00:03:06.041 --> 00:03:09.708
This comparison reveals a deep truth –

57
00:03:09.708 --> 00:03:12.375
material nature creates the body,

58
00:03:12.375 --> 00:03:15.958
but life comes only when Lord Krishna

59
00:03:15.958 --> 00:03:18.583
provides the soul’s seed.

60
00:03:18.583 --> 00:03:20.916
Without Him, matter remains inert

61
00:03:20.916 --> 00:03:23.041
and inactive.

62
00:03:23.041 --> 00:03:24.083
Jivatmas then

63
00:03:24.083 --> 00:03:26.166
according to their past karma

64
00:03:26.166 --> 00:03:28.416
take on various forms.

65
00:03:28.416 --> 00:03:30.041
This entire process

66
00:03:30.041 --> 00:03:33.333
is directed by Lord Krishna’s will.

67
00:03:33.333 --> 00:03:37.208
Through these verses, Lord Krishna establishes

68
00:03:37.208 --> 00:03:38.541
that although the jivatma

69
00:03:38.541 --> 00:03:40.625
becomes associated with a material body,

70
00:03:40.625 --> 00:03:44.500
it remains spiritual at its core.

71
00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:46.791
When we understand this relationship

72
00:03:46.791 --> 00:03:50.166
between the jivatma, prakriti, and Lord Krishna,

73
00:03:50.166 --> 00:03:55.166
we move in the direction of
crossing material bondage.

74
00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:01.125
If I am

75
00:04:01.125 --> 00:04:04.916
the seed-giving father, then think –

76
00:04:04.916 --> 00:04:06.291
what are you,

77
00:04:06.291 --> 00:04:10.583
and what are all the people around you?

78
00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:16.125
You are all children of the same divine family.

79
00:04:16.125 --> 00:04:20.166
The moment this truth settles within you,

80
00:04:20.166 --> 00:04:22.833
everything changes.

81
00:04:22.833 --> 00:04:26.291
You stop seeing others only through
the lens of their class,

82
00:04:26.291 --> 00:04:27.583
background, religion,

83
00:04:27.583 --> 00:04:28.833
profession,

84
00:04:28.833 --> 00:04:32.500
or present behaviour.

85
00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:36.583
You begin to recognise that every person

86
00:04:36.583 --> 00:04:38.166
is a soul –

87
00:04:38.166 --> 00:04:40.000
just like you,

88
00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:44.250
on their own journey, trying to fulfil their desires

89
00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:48.000
with what they have.

90
00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:50.041
Some will have moved further along,

91
00:04:50.041 --> 00:04:53.625
some will be walking slowly – but all

92
00:04:53.625 --> 00:04:56.375
are connected to Me.

93
00:04:56.375 --> 00:04:59.375
From this understanding, a quiet respect

94
00:04:59.375 --> 00:05:02.666
for everyone is born.

95
00:05:02.666 --> 00:05:06.125
You no longer need to compete, judge,

96
00:05:06.125 --> 00:05:09.375
or compare.

97
00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:11.125
You begin to treat people

98
00:05:11.125 --> 00:05:14.291
with compassion –

99
00:05:14.291 --> 00:05:17.500
not because they have earned it,

100
00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:22.916
but because they too are connected to Me,

101
00:05:22.916 --> 00:05:24.708
just as you are.

102
00:05:24.708 --> 00:05:27.125
Families work this way,

103
00:05:27.125 --> 00:05:28.375
don’t they?

104
00:05:28.375 --> 00:05:33.208
Not everyone is equally capable,
but everyone belongs.

105
00:05:33.208 --> 00:05:36.000
When you truly see others

106
00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:39.625
as My children,

107
00:05:39.625 --> 00:05:43.458
you naturally become more patient,

108
00:05:43.458 --> 00:05:47.500
more forgiving, more compassionate.

109
00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:51.541
Think of this – in youth, a father

110
00:05:51.541 --> 00:05:54.416
may have wanted to achieve something in sport

111
00:05:54.416 --> 00:05:56.041
but could not.

112
00:05:56.041 --> 00:05:59.500
Years later, when his son

113
00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:00.583
or nephew

114
00:06:00.583 --> 00:06:03.750
becomes the finest player in that game,

115
00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.875
he feels fulfilled –

116
00:06:05.875 --> 00:06:09.541
that his dream was completed by his family.

117
00:06:09.541 --> 00:06:13.916
Now imagine – when the whole world
becomes your family,

118
00:06:13.916 --> 00:06:18.541
will not every achievement give
you that same joy?

119
00:06:18.541 --> 00:06:20.083
It certainly will.

120
00:06:20.083 --> 00:06:24.750
Whoever wins, the delight will be yours.

121
00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:28.375
This is the beginning of spiritual maturity –

122
00:06:28.375 --> 00:06:31.000
when your love for Me

123
00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:32.666
begins to show in how

124
00:06:32.666 --> 00:06:35.166
you treat My people.

125
00:06:39.791 --> 00:06:42.750
Every being you see –

126
00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:47.666
man, woman, infant, animal, bird, insect –

127
00:06:47.666 --> 00:06:50.958
all have arisen from Me.

128
00:06:50.958 --> 00:06:55.291
I am the seed-giving father

129
00:06:55.291 --> 00:06:58.666
and material nature is the mother.

130
00:06:58.666 --> 00:07:00.166
This means –

131
00:07:00.166 --> 00:07:05.458
we are all part of one vast family.

132
00:07:05.458 --> 00:07:09.458
The differences you see – form, strength, colour,

133
00:07:09.458 --> 00:07:13.916
capacity – these are only outer coverings.

134
00:07:13.916 --> 00:07:16.750
Within, the soul is one.

135
00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:19.791
Yet how often do people consider some form

136
00:07:19.791 --> 00:07:24.208
‘lesser’ or ‘less important’ and use
this to justify violence

137
00:07:24.208 --> 00:07:28.291
or cruelty.

138
00:07:28.291 --> 00:07:31.166
People show selective compassion –

139
00:07:31.166 --> 00:07:33.666
they love dogs,

140
00:07:33.666 --> 00:07:36.333
neglect cows,

141
00:07:36.333 --> 00:07:38.625
admire peacocks,

142
00:07:38.625 --> 00:07:42.750
yet fear snakes.

143
00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:46.333
If they truly understood

144
00:07:46.333 --> 00:07:48.416
that I am equally

145
00:07:48.416 --> 00:07:52.625
the seed-giver in every form,

146
00:07:52.625 --> 00:07:56.000
their hearts would soften.

147
00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.750
I do not make one species

148
00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:01.916
more valuable than another.

149
00:08:01.916 --> 00:08:03.208
Every being

150
00:08:03.208 --> 00:08:08.166
takes on its form according to its past karma,

151
00:08:08.166 --> 00:08:09.458
but within

152
00:08:09.458 --> 00:08:12.333
the same divine spark remains.

153
00:08:12.333 --> 00:08:15.291
If society wishes for peace,

154
00:08:15.291 --> 00:08:19.000
it must begin with this vision –

155
00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:22.291
the source of every living being is divine.

156
00:08:22.291 --> 00:08:25.458
When you live with this vision –

157
00:08:25.458 --> 00:08:28.500
treating every creature with kindness, respect,

158
00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:31.541
and compassion –

159
00:08:31.541 --> 00:08:34.916
you bring harmony not only to your home

160
00:08:34.916 --> 00:08:39.833
but to the whole world.

161
00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:42.000
This is the society

162
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.958
I envision –

163
00:08:44.958 --> 00:08:47.166
one that lives in love,

164
00:08:47.166 --> 00:08:49.666
with unity as its root.

165
00:08:54.375 --> 00:08:55.833
Material nature

166
00:08:55.833 --> 00:09:00.125
is not a resource to be exploited –

167
00:09:00.125 --> 00:09:02.333
it is My energy.

168
00:09:02.333 --> 00:09:04.500
I have called it the mother,

169
00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:07.708
who gives birth to all forms of life.

170
00:09:07.708 --> 00:09:08.625
Just as a mother

171
00:09:08.625 --> 00:09:12.541
nourishes and protects her children,

172
00:09:12.541 --> 00:09:15.625
this very prakriti sustains your industries,

173
00:09:15.625 --> 00:09:16.750
your homes,

174
00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:19.791
and your daily life.

175
00:09:19.791 --> 00:09:21.250
But tell Me –

176
00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:26.083
should a child not respect its mother?

177
00:09:26.083 --> 00:09:29.458
When businesses pour waste into rivers,

178
00:09:29.458 --> 00:09:31.083
poison the air,

179
00:09:31.083 --> 00:09:36.041
or ruthlessly extract natural resources,

180
00:09:36.041 --> 00:09:39.750
they forget this sacred relationship.

181
00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:43.041
Think of your vehicle –

182
00:09:43.041 --> 00:09:45.875
what a great convenience it is for you.

183
00:09:45.875 --> 00:09:48.416
You regularly check the tyre pressure,

184
00:09:48.416 --> 00:09:49.333
the engine oil,

185
00:09:49.333 --> 00:09:50.416
the coolant,

186
00:09:50.416 --> 00:09:53.041
and get it serviced.

187
00:09:53.041 --> 00:09:55.708
If this is neglected, the vehicle

188
00:09:55.708 --> 00:09:59.375
eventually stops –

189
00:09:59.375 --> 00:10:00.125
perhaps

190
00:10:00.125 --> 00:10:04.000
at the most critical moment.

191
00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:09.166
Prakriti is the same –
when not properly maintained, 

192
00:10:09.166 --> 00:10:11.875
it disrupts the work.

193
00:10:11.875 --> 00:10:16.291
And what we call disaster is exactly that.

194
00:10:16.291 --> 00:10:19.000
Prakriti endures much,

195
00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:22.791
but when pushed too far,

196
00:10:22.791 --> 00:10:26.750
the results match –

197
00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:29.875
climate imbalance, disasters,

198
00:10:29.875 --> 00:10:32.583
loss of biodiversity.

199
00:10:32.583 --> 00:10:35.833
These are not punishments – they
are consequences.

200
00:10:35.833 --> 00:10:37.125
True leadership

201
00:10:37.125 --> 00:10:39.708
in the professional world means –

202
00:10:39.708 --> 00:10:45.166
seeing beyond profit alone.

203
00:10:45.166 --> 00:10:47.916
If you regard prakriti as mother,

204
00:10:47.916 --> 00:10:50.625
your decisions will reflect gratitude,

205
00:10:50.625 --> 00:10:52.125
not greed.

206
00:10:52.125 --> 00:10:55.291
Sustainable practices, mindful consumption,

207
00:10:55.291 --> 00:10:58.541
and conscious innovation –

208
00:10:58.541 --> 00:11:01.458
these are how you honour prakriti.

209
00:11:01.458 --> 00:11:04.666
And when you do this,

210
00:11:04.666 --> 00:11:07.291
I take notice.

211
00:11:07.291 --> 00:11:09.583
Those who care for My energy

212
00:11:09.583 --> 00:11:13.291
with love and responsibility –

213
00:11:13.291 --> 00:11:17.083
I give them the strength to grow –

214
00:11:17.083 --> 00:11:19.916
not only in business, but

215
00:11:19.916 --> 00:11:23.416
in character and deep fulfilment.

216
00:11:23.416 --> 00:11:28.541
Let your enterprise not exploit this great prakriti,

217
00:11:28.541 --> 00:11:32.416
but flourish by protecting the very source

218
00:11:32.416 --> 00:11:34.833
that nourishes it.
